  "body": "Property Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/AEQC\r\n\r\nThis much-loved freehold family home with income delivers exceptional flexibility, comfort, and lifestyle appeal in the heart of the North Shore's most sought-after school zones.\r\n\r\nThe main residence is warm and welcoming, thoughtfully designed for family living. It features four generous bedrooms, a study, and three bathrooms. A large separate lounge and dining room are enhanced by a charming back-to-back fireplace, creating both ambience and warmth. The dining and family room flow seamlessly onto a sun-soaked balcony perfect for morning coffees, family meals, or relaxed evenings enjoying the sunset.\r\n\r\nThe fully equipped kitchen is designed to keep the family connected. The master suite includes a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while two additional bedrooms and a study are serviced by a well-appointed family bathroom. Downstairs, a rumpus room and an extra bedroom with its own bathroom and external access open onto a huge covered deck ideal for teenagers, extended family, or a flatmate. A laundry, ample storage, and a double carport complete the main home.\r\n\r\nAdding even more value is the legal two-bedroom income unit. Light, private, and comfortable, it offers open-plan kitchen, dining, and living spaces flowing to a balcony, with one bedroom also opening outdoors. The existing tenant is happy to remain, providing immediate and reliable income from day one.\r\n\r\nThe location is outstanding. Walk to Murrays Bay Primary, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College, and in zone for Northcross Intermediate. Enjoy weekends at Murrays Bay or Mairangi Bay Beach, cafés and shops in Mairangi Bay Village, and easy access to AUT Millennium, Pupuke Golf Club, Constellation Park & Ride, and the motorway network.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a growing family, a savvy investor, or seeking a versatile home with genuine income potential, this is an opportunity that truly stands out. The vendor is downsizing and the property will be sold, secure your future here and arrange your private viewing today.\r\n\r\n*Conjunctions from all Agents welcome*",
